t(39, 435, """Stop the bleeding caused by the network's toying with minds .. so people do not go astray .. We have moved into a new dimension .. Some people now issue fatwas ((in religion)) just like this! Do not go astray! Lying about Allah has become terrifying .. frightening .. earth-shaking .. Some people do not know what their tongues are saying! They sleep, then say: "Allah has shown us such and such ((in religion))" .. "Allah has informed us on such-and-such an issue ((about religion)) of such and such" .. "Allah has revealed to us ((in religion)) such and such"! If these misguided ones have no mercy on themselves, then let the followers have mercy on themselves and save themselves from this manifest misguidance.

This post does not generalise about all its readers; people of knowledge, understanding and insight are many.""")

t(39, 1565, """Arab societies whose streets have garbage literally everywhere .. in every square metre, in every corner! As if garbage were something very delightful, with insects, flies and many calamities gathering on it! And all the people and all the residents live alongside it, and no one takes the initiative to do anything! And this has been the situation in those countries for many years!""")

t(39, 2505, """How I pity these people! In the big cities .. where life is hard and earning a lawful living is hard .. they sell conscience .. morals .. everything .. and they bend down to the ground to pick up what falls from the masters' pockets .. and they eat it having despised themselves inside and lost their self-respect!""")

t(40, 915, """Many people are prisoners of their own minds and ideas .. Correcting concepts is a reform of homes, of livelihood and of all of life""")

t(40, 1790, """When the soul argues in defence of its deeds! In this world, heedlessness and laughter .. and in the Hereafter, regret and sorrow .. In this world, assaulting people and harassing them .. and in the Hereafter, asking for pardon on a day when regret is of no use!""")

t(41, 170, """Your road will not be empty .. it will not be free of snakes in human clothing .. You are not asked, as a human being, to imagine that the world is empty and that you are alone in it .. Rather, the truth is that the road will never be empty .. So instead of busying yourself with wishing for an empty world in which you can rest .. learn and train to confront them""")

t(41, 1125, """I am the best of mankind .. I am the best of people .. I am the most excellent of mankind .. the most righteous of them .. I use visions to accuse people of being corrupt .. I do not see my own calamities .. nor do I see my disasters .. nor do I see my shortcomings towards Allah .. I do not see my own reality .. But I have decided to use my channel to tell people "so-and-so is righteous and so-and-so is wicked" on the basis of visions that come to me .. I have decided to interfere in people's Hereafter .. I classify them not by their deeds nor by their words .. but by visions that come to me .. I classify them as hypocrites and liars not because they did something bad .. but because of visions that come to me and agree with my soul's whim in my hatred of this one and my loathing of that one .. So I tell people: "So-and-so is a liar and a hypocrite, and so-and-so is acting righteous before you", because I hate him and cannot stand him .. People ask me: "What did he do?" I say: "He did every good, but he is acting!" People ask me: "How did you know he is acting? Is there any proof?" I say: "Visions came to me and told me what he hides from people, and that he is acting before them!" """)

t(41, 2290, """He who feels safe from punishment behaves badly""")

t(42, 650, """A story and a lesson .. Taking lightly the use of visions to spread corruption on earth!!
"Relax, man .. there's no danger .. take it easy .. Curse him as much as you like, don't worry .. What can I swear by to you that he is a dajjal, a swindler, a hypocrite and one of the people of the Fire, and that he is acting religious before people .. Yes, the visions told me so, man .. The visions told me, by Allah .. Of course .. do you think I'm playing!" """)

t(42, 1630, """I present to you Rida the Tunisian .. He will change your religion for you .. He will change the month of Ramadan for you .. And he will mislead 100 thousand people .. They will fast in month 9 .. Do not be alarmed .. With Rida, Islam is more beautiful .. Welcome with Rida .. Come on, Rida .. Go .. go and spread corruption on earth as you wish""")

t(43, 755, """The channel is being subjected to harassment.. We may move to the alternative channel""")

t(43, 1030, """Some channels have utterly slaughtered people by broadcasting ignorance, and destroyed people's morale. Had they destroyed people's morale with knowledge, we would have said, "They spoke with knowledge"; but the calamity is that they destroyed people's morale with ignorance .. "Our master, what is the future of the Muslims? Good or evil?" "My children .. my children .. my children .. I see everything .. I see clearly .. I see evil .. evil .. evil and nothing else .. evil, evil .. evil, and I see nothing else .. evil, evil, my children .. evil, evil!!" """)

t(43, 2235, """The picture is global; it does not speak about any particular country .. This time .. the drowning will strike many from both parties, because many people have become drunk on its wine .. So let us seek the help of Allah our Lord, that we and our offspring may be saved by the power of our Great Lord""")

t(44, 855, """{Or like layers of darkness in a deep sea, covered by a wave, above which is a wave, above which are clouds: layers of darkness, one upon another. When he puts out his hand he can hardly see it. And he to whom Allah gives no light has no light at all}""")

t(44, 1925, """Europe after the Third World War .. Allah knows best .. if the report is true

Abd al-Razzaq informed us, he said: Ma'mar informed us from Ayyub, from Ibn Sirin, from Uqbah ibn Aws al-Dawsi, from Abdullah ibn Amr ibn al-As, who said: "Over the Romans there will be a king whom they do not disobey - or hardly ever disobey." """)

t(45, 1710, """He appeared to me on a live stream .. I went in .. I found him mumbling, with his group around him .. I picked up a sweet potato .. I looked at him and said to him: "I don't like this scene; you have time only until I finish eating this potato" .. I finished the last piece of it, and at that he stopped mumbling, got up and stood on his feet! I don't know .. Perhaps he felt an urge to stop mumbling and stand up! Perhaps it is something else we don't understand! I am not from that world to understand much! And 10 seconds after he stood on his feet, the broadcast was cut off at the source! It happened a little while ago! Something striking, which I relate by way of light relief, even though it is a real scene that happened!

As for these groups, I still call upon the reason in them .. the logic .. and the self-respect .. I hope you will take a stand with yourselves, for your own sake, not for ours""")

t(46, 580, """How many families - Palestinian, Egyptian, Yemeni, Sudanese, Algerian, Moroccan, Tunisian, Libyan, from the Arabian Peninsula, Turkish, Pakistani, Afghan, Bangladeshi, Arakanese, Mauritanian, Nigerian, Chadian, Somali, Comorian, Indonesian, Malaysian, Libyan, Western, Turkestani, Russian, Ukrainian, Filipino, Indian and others .. Lights, safe and tranquil homes and a new social life in the cities of the world, where man was deprived of his rest for a very long time .. deprived of his humanity .. deprived of catching his breath .. deprived of catching his breath .. As if a hidden enemy who hates man .. who hates the sons and daughters of Adam, decided at some moment in history to torment them all .. to torment every one of them without distinguishing between race, colour and religion!""")

t(46, 1980, """The picture is approximate as regards the middle of the body, since he ﷺ was wearing a large black turban with a great deal of cloth, part of which hung down over his noble body ﷺ. This picture gives an approximate explanation of the clothes the Prophet ﷺ was wearing in the vision, since one of the brothers asked what clothes were like in the old days, in the time of the Prophet ﷺ. What is clear in the vision is that there were garments beneath it, and it is clear that it was not directly on the body - this is certain - nor close to the skin (the body), and this too is certain. As for today's jalabiya, it is very close to the body, almost directly on it, and this is a clear difference between the clothes of the Prophet ﷺ and the contemporary jalabiya that people wear today.""")

t(47, 790, """My brothers, the men .. the youth .. the boys .. the children of our Islamic world .. Appearances unbefitting the right of Allah the Great, our Lord, at Friday prayer in the mosques .. Trousers with a long shirt over them .. trousers with a long top over them .. ((none of this will do)) .. In prostration this will not do .. it will not do .. This will do only when you walk .. or when you stand .. but never in prostration .. it will not do .. Nothing is fit for prayer except the Arab thobe known in all the Arab countries in its various designs .. and trousers with a relatively short jalabiya over them, like the Pakistani, Indian or Bengali clothes worn by the Muslims in those countries, and anything similar, such as the Western overcoat .. Anything else, for prayer, is not permissible .. it is not allowed .. it is not right to pray in it .. It is not right for a man to prostrate when his top has ridden up off his body and his shirt has ridden up off his body .. Today at Friday prayer I saw unbefitting scenes; they are shameful, do not suit public taste and offend others, and the essential point is that they are shameful towards Allah the Great, the King .. How can a person prostrate to Allah, his Lord and God, exposing the details of his body?! You are prostrating to the King .. you are prostrating to God and the Lord .. And He sees you from above you, from every place and from every direction; so let your Lord see you in what befits Him, hallowed be His names, because what matters is Him, not you.

May Allah have mercy on you; the following pictures are the only clothes suitable for prayer in the mosque and at home""")

t(47, 2315, """Two young tigers, an exhausted lion and a dead tiger (earthly powers) .. and a moon (a heavenly power) .. And world peace is near, Allah willing""")

t(48, 945, """It is no longer "making a dome out of a grain" .. the grain of wheat has become a mountain! The amount of fabrications on the channels .. The mawlid of their master YouTube .. a mawlid whose patron is absent .. A message to the breaking-news channels .. If an apple falls from a tree in Ukraine, they keep us busy with thousands of videos .. and if a kid goat coughs in the Himalaya mountains, thousands of breaking-news videos are made!""")

t(48, 2120, """Arabs who emigrated to the West after the end of the Third World War, listening to the news in a Parisian restaurant""")

t(49, 690, """One of the pictures of the future .. Allah the Exalted is Most High and knows best .. As has come in narrations from the books of Ahl al-Sunnah about the displacement of a great number of people to the West in future times, and they will take their dogs with them!""")

t(49, 1810, """Writers, speakers and spokesmen .. Events from the future .. Allah the Exalted is Most High and knows best .. As has come in narrations from the books of Ahl al-Sunnah that dealt with the displacement of many people to the West for various and different reasons!""")

t(51, 675, """The final round is coming .. All the other seats will be empty""")

t(51, 1665, """Check-in .. The queue will be long""")

h(51, 2000, """The long journey of pains""")

t(52, 110, """100 years .. For 100 years we have been sitting like this .. For 100 years we have been looking at the paper .. For 100 years we have been incapable even of incapacity itself .. For 100 years lost, even while standing on every road fit for arriving .. Yet still lost .. Astray like a child whose mother lost him in a crowded train station when the power suddenly went out .. when people jostled and everything collided with everything .. The wicked raised him; he drank of all their treachery, learned all their letters and took on all their gestures, and he no longer knew which of the distant shores was worth reaching .. Then the sky lit up .. And with the dawn, out of the distant villages came every abducted man and woman; they gathered, and the light led them to the shore where there are no tables, no seats, no pens and no chairs .. but rather the screams of all the chains and shackles as they are weaned for the first time in 100 years .. weaned off our necks, our legs and our hands .. and they cry to the executioner for help, to save them from the will of the Lord! They will scream, and the executioner will not save them from the Lord! He will not save them, because the time is our time .. The dawn is ours .. The word is ours .. The podium is ours .. The verdict and the ruling are ours .. The age is our age .. And the chains are no longer able to have a say over us ever again!""")

t(52, 1485, """It is not just that the neighbour in the south should go on pulling the cart like this forever! The difference is enormous, and the one being pulled is determined to remain pulled, and determined that the north remain pampered and rich and the south poor, lost and astray! This has gone on too long .. The matter has become too absurd to be borne any longer!""")

h(53, 300, """The pleasure of our Lord, the Most Merciful, is everything; and all else is branches of a tree""")

t(53, 985, """This is the future of our Ummah, by Allah's permission .. Some Muslims are very angry at my posting pictures of the future .. They slander and sneer .. Their state is distress .. Poor things! This is the future of our Ummah, Allah willing .. So whoever among the Muslims feels anger when he sees these pictures, O Allah, guide him .. And whoever slanders and sneers merely because of my love and my wish that the Muslims take glad tidings of good, then, if Allah the Great our Lord wills, he will walk in this street one day and say, "I wish I had not committed that offence!" """)

t(53, 2165, """4 million Afghans addicted to drugs because of the results of 20 years of war! In the picture is a news item about the state taking the addicts to treatment and rehabilitation centres, with great difficulty in catching them to treat them. But .. as in the picture, the only bad thing is an Afghan policeman slapping a journalist who is taking photos .. Clearly the culture of "I am a policeman, meaning I am above the people" is a global culture!""")

t(54, 705, """To the men .. Your physical, muscular strength is not only in what your eyes see .. Nor is it only through tangible material tools (loads and weights) .. The original source of real muscular strength is the inner strength latent within the soul .. You can make your parallel body within your soul fill with strength without going to a weightlifting centre to train every day, contenting yourself with light training at home .. There is a real strength inside every one of us .. And what is right is to build your strength, not your body, and the difference between the two terms is great .. The matter is neither magic nor charlatanry nor energy, and it has nothing to do with energy and the charlatanries of the energy dajjals .. It is a strength in the soul, created along with the soul .. Using it means being able to feel it, because it exists .. Feeling it is not easy .. It requires clarity of mind .. tranquillity of soul .. and humility before the Lord of strength in all its kinds and states .. Our Great Lord, hallowed be His names, is the Lord of strength .. its Creator and its Originator within you .. Like the eagle when it folds its wings upon its body; thus we realise that ability in man is an original branch of the possibilities of the Lord, not of the possibilities of means alone .. Because millions lift weights for years and do not reach the physical strength of a man who may know how to build his strength and then his body! As for gym-goers, they reverse the matter .. They build the body in order to release the body's strength .. Nothing of what I write here did I read in some place or book .. But I understand from personal experience that what builds the body's muscles is the latent inner strength in the parallel body, before building the muscle by lifting weights; and without releasing the strength latent within the soul, your arm muscle will look very huge but will not be of tremendous strength! You may lift 150 kilos, but that is the lifting of muscular build, not the lifting of the inner strength, whose limits are unimaginably vast. With the strength that is in you, you can change much about yourself .. With it you can change your physical capabilities and build your body, and not the reverse, as those who frequent bodybuilding clubs do .. The body - as I address it, trying to understand it - is never flesh and blood .. And it is never merely this structure that your eyes see from the outside, and from the inside as it has been pictured for you .. All this is matter .. And your original reality is not matter .. This""")

t(54, 1365, """matter is a vessel for your original reality .. the soul .. All strength is in the soul .. It is not in the limbs of the body and the muscles of the hand .. When you build your arms, there are two ways .. The way customary with perhaps all people .. lifting weights .. But the soul has another opinion .. Lifting weights is matter's own conception of itself .. the arms' conception of themselves .. how the muscle (matter) grows .. The muscle is matter .. But the soul is not matter .. The soul is far stronger than matter .. stronger than the muscle, even if it were extremely huge, of a builder who built his body over the years .. In the soul there is a flame that is released if the spirit is activated .. If the spirit rises and ascends, the spirit itself can operate the soul's strength that people do not use, because the soul is a body reflected from the material body; in the soul there is a face other than the material face, and it has a heart, intestines, a liver, a stomach and so on, all of them a reflection of the tangible material organs .. And the tangible material organs - as I have understood from my reflection on the soul and the body, my contemplation and my experience - those tangible material organs are affected, positively and negatively, by the intangible, immaterial organs which are realised as an immaterial reflection within the soul. Therefore the sound, correct spiritual movement towards Allah the Exalted, and the ascent towards Allah the Great our Lord, makes the spirit ruler over the soul and operator of its latent strength; and then the spirit will wish for the body things at which the body will marvel, while it is in its worldly state and under the laws of its perishable matter. And then whoever goes through the experience will find how a little effort in achieving physical strength, perhaps by lifting 20 kilos, can indeed, by the power of Allah the Exalted, bring you results greater than the effort of lifting 200 kilos. Personally, I have tried all these many words I have just written and seen their results with my own eyes, but .. the moves from land to land and the earlier dispersal brought everything to a halt .. And though today I am outside all of that, there is no harm in others benefiting from the experience.""")

t(54, 2080, """When you look at the youth .. when you meet the youth .. when you talk to them .. eat with them .. chat with them .. I do not mean only your own children .. When you look at the youth .. contemplating their reality and their present and calling to mind your opinions about their future, look at them only with the spirit of those who realise how much this new generation has been wronged .. marginalised .. excluded .. kept ignorant .. and had its energy crushed all over the world except the West .. Look at them with an eye that is not so tender as to put them in a baby's cradle and rock it .. but with the eye of the mother who embraces even while she is dying .. with the eye of every true father who loved and was a true father .. with the highest eye, the purity of the prophets when they saw - and foremost among them our Prophet ﷺ - when they saw the future in the youth .. Because the future is in the youth .. And because the future is the youth .. They do not necessarily have to be your sons when they pass by you in the street .. when you meet them at an event, a celebration or a place .. All the youth are children of every father and mother .. Our youth have been wronged .. And they deserve a tomorrow better than the present and the past that we lived .. And the smile of every young person, the joy of every young person and the peace of mind of every young person is a pledge upon every father and mother, to be carried along the road of pains on which we have been, and still are, treading .. But it does not matter .. Continue the road of pains for their sake .. The youth deserve it.""")

t(55, 180, """The human soul, and the human mind bound to it, is not a component of single composition! The matter is very complex, more complex than man imagines .. Hundreds of things share in our makeup, not tens .. That is why spouses clash .. fathers and mothers clash with children .. siblings clash .. people clash .. society .. The matter is extremely complex .. We are a structure .. and not just any structure .. We are a structure made of much .. not a structure made of little .. All who spoke superficially on this issue said that we are built of genes, inheritance, human psychological impulses, and experience in the environment and its effect; but we are more complex than that .. far more complex than that .. Expanding on it is in itself very complex .. So I will be content with saying: do not look at the other as though he were composed as you are composed! This is the greatest of the mistakes people commit every day! The composition is not only dissimilar, not only non-identical, and not only out of harmony and mutual support .. If only that were all .. There are inner psychological-bodily forces that are not from another world and not from outside the soul, but are an original part of the soul, having nothing to do with jinn or magic .. Something in you .. you as a human being .. something in you speaks in silence, neither declaring nor shouting! Something very deep .. pulls you .. inside your soul .. in its creation .. And this pull, which I had not understood or felt with this clarity before .. the matter with this pull is not only that it affects your mind, your thinking, your mental, psychological, intellectual and ideational makeup and your behaviour.. The matter is so complex that man himself is shaken as he passes through some or many of the behavioural stations of others .. I feel that this matter is in every one of us .. There is an inner call, abysmal, deep, very far within the soul; the place of the voice cannot easily be reached .. The voice comes from an abysmal place .. As if it were the first call .. As if it were the first moment of creation, which we do not remember .. As if it were the moment of bearing witness to the Oneness, when it was the soul that testified that day and not the body .. There is something in your depths, O man, drawing near .. In a revealing moment of light - and Allah knows best - it will happen to those who harmed us, one day, when they will hear - and Allah knows best - that distant, abysmal call, with which they lived long years without even knowing of it .. What matters is that we understand, now and today, that the existence in our lives of the wicked, of those who wear us out and of those who harm us, is an extremely logical matter according to this description .. And the existence of those who love us and fear for us is also the very logical opposite of the harmful group .. Why are there those who harm us? Because they did not reach where the voice is .. the distant voice which, when it speaks, says: "I am the first creation .. I am the origin of your creation and your formation! I am the conscience" .. It exists, but it is buried in them in a place farther from us than the sun, the stars and the universes. Farther, even though the place is only centimetres away!""")

t(55, 1205, """Like the prophets of Allah the Exalted, among them Yusuf, and like Ya'qub, like Ibrahim, like Ayyub, like Yunus, like Muhammad, like Isa, like Musa, like Dawud, like Sulayman, like Lut and like Salih, upon them be blessings and peace
Beware of thinking, whether you are a man or a woman, that it is a closing of banishment and wrath against you .. It is a closing of selection and choosing ..

This is never a sky closed upon you .. The closing is always partial and never total.. It is a sky behind whose now-closed door there is a great generosity coming, and a relief that mends your fractures .. Coming .. coming for certain, by the permission of Allah the Great our Lord""")

t(55, 2395, """A day will surely come when every mocker will wish he had boarded, and everyone whom Satan led astray, toyed with his mind, seduced, and blinded to the truth that was before his eyes, plain and clear as the sun! All that is sound in religion is plain, clearer than the sun .. Every justice is clear and plain as the sun .. Every whim of the soul is misguidance .. as clear as the sun""")

t(56, 930, """Peace be upon you from Jerusalem .. I am from the future, Allah willing .. I may be unknown .. but for certain, by the power of our Lord, we shall return to it .. I may be Algerian .. Egyptian .. Yemeni .. Turkish .. or from anywhere in the Islamic world .. It does not matter .. What matters is that, Allah willing, I will be here in this place one day.""")

t(56, 1975, """What, one wonders, is the difference between the plotting of man .. and the plotting of the Lord? Can we make a comparison? The answer is established in everyone's mind, definitely, for every person of reason. Comparison is impossible! But what are some of the features of Allah's plotting among people?! In history?! In the course of history, its events, its paths, its scenarios, its circumstances and its outcomes?!

If you reflected, you would find wonders!

On this earth .. and specifically in the events of history .. of the plotting of Allah the Great our Lord is diminishing and completing .. obscuring and clarifying .. igniting and extinguishing .. And of the plotting of Allah the Great our Lord in the happenings of history is showing black as white and white as black .. diminishing perfection and completing something of deficiency .. And of it is hiding the stereotyped images conceived in the mind and bringing forth the inconceivable anomaly! And nullifying the possible and unleashing the impossible, silencing the expected and giving voice to what the mind cannot believe .. And of it - that is, of His plotting, hallowed be His names - is working the miraculous through utter lack of means, and rendering powerless the one wrapped in every means .. And of it - that is, of His plotting, hallowed be His names - is entrenching the illusion built by the mind and uprooting the truth that belongs to the hidden, inevitable decree .. And of it also is deluding with cleverness the one deluded about his own cleverness, and making the soul utterly confident of the idea .. And of it is locking the mind, so that it sees only what the eye sees and what the ear hears, while the truth is far, abysmally far, there in the heights, in the heavens, not on earth!""")

t(57, 965, """Unfortunately .. people's affairs are not set right without force .. authority .. and law; otherwise the catastrophe will be great .. Whoever thinks moral harshness does not exist is lacking much reflection .. Moral harshness is at a very high moral rank, for preventing catastrophes before they happen! And whoever abandons his moral role in realising, bringing down and applying moral harshness is lax in realising justice on earth. This harshness has degrees, the highest of which is the raised voice, if the person in front of you understands only this language. In the picture is a man of authority and power .. The policeman applauds him .. And the weak old man who gives advice is pelted with stones!""")

t(57, 2130, """Virtuous cities cannot be built upon people without the force of law, for among people there will always be the good and the wicked, even if they all lived in the virtuous city""")
